# Sightline is a static site. Nothing here is built, and nothing secret belongs in it.
# The Gemini key is entered by each user at runtime and stored in their own browser,
# so it must never appear in a file in this repository.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Internal working documents are deliberately kept out of this repository and live
# alongside it instead, in ../Sightline docs/. Listed here so that dropping a copy
# back into the folder does not quietly publish it.
PRD.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
DESIGN.md
PROMPTING.md
RULES.md
MEMORY.md
README-full.md
